  "prefLabel": "Lan 403.01 Minimum Standards for Renewal of License",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-07-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lan 403.01 Minimum Standards for Renewal of License.\n\n(a) As required by RSA 310-A:68, each licensee shall provide evidence of continued education prior to receiving a license renewal.\n\n(b) The minimum number of continuing education units (CEUs) as set forth in Lan 403.03 shall be 8 per biennium.\n\n(c) One CEU shall be equivalent to 4 hours of actual time spent in activities set forth in Lan 403.03.\n\nSource. #5934, eff 12-9-94, EXPIRED: 12-9-00\n\nNew. #7425, INTERIM, eff 1-13-01, EXPIRED: 7-12-01\n\nNew. #7549, 8-25-01; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lan100-500.html"
